<section class="ls-visual-episode ls-container is-reversed">
<div class="ls-episode-copy">
<p class="ls-eyebrow">THE METHOD IS PART OF THE DOCUMENT</p>
<h2>DESCRIBE IT.<br/>INSPECT IT.<br/>
<span class="ls-stroke">MAKE IT YOURS.</span>
</h2>
<div class="ls-episode-dek">
<p>Choose files, folders and named public pages. Create jobs and data definitions in visual editors. Bind the result to a table or chart.</p>
<p>A local model can draft a definition. Read its steps and preview before choosing to use it.</p>
</div>
</div>
